  "prefLabel": "Per 1204.09 Layoff Recall",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 1204.09 Layoff Recall. Whenever a former employee who has been laid off from state service is recalled within 3 years as provided for under Per 1100, the previously accumulated and unused balance of sick leave allowance shall be restored and placed to the employee's credit.\n\nSource. #8738, eff 10-18-06; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15; ss by #14436, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES: 12-1-35 (formerly Per 1204.10)",
